{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_9_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para:efficacy:framework\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章疗效评估框架覆盖主要终点、关键次要终点SNOT-22和描述性次要终点Lund-Kennedy。评估工具包括双侧鼻息肉评分（NPS）、鼻塞VAS、SNOT-22量表和Lund-Kennedy内镜评分。主要分析集为FAS；主要终点缺失采用无应答插补，敏感性分析采用tipping point；关键次要终点采用固定序列检验控制多重性。主要终点直接复用已确认的主要终点事实，并回链已确认的主要目的与主要估计目标；本节不新增无法回链研究目的或估计目标的疗效终点。评估时点与已接受SoA一致：基线在首次给药前评估；主要终点和次要终点均在第24周评估；SNOT-22和Lund-Kennedy较基线变化以第24周为评价时点。本节不另行设定与已接受SoA冲突的访视窗口。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para:efficacy:primary_endpoint\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"主要终点为第24周临床缓解率，定义为第24周达到双侧NPS≤1且鼻塞VAS≤1的受试者比例。采用的主要终点测量口径为：双侧NPS按每侧0～4分、总分0～8分计算；鼻塞VAS采用0～10 cm视觉模拟量表，缓解阈值≤1分。NPS由经过培训的研究者或耳鼻喉科评估者实施，尽可能由同一评估者在各访视进行；评估者需接受方案、评分标准和一致性培训。鼻塞VAS由受试者按方案指导完成。NPS和鼻塞VAS的基线评估在首次给药前完成；主要终点在第24周评估。主要终点测量口径与主要估计目标一致：人群为成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者（FAS，ITT原则），变量为第24周临床缓解，治疗为合成药X 150 mg皮下方案对比安慰剂，伴发事件（ICE）按治疗策略处理，群体汇总为缓解率比例，采用按中心分层CMH检验，报告风险差及95%CI。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para:efficacy:secondary_endpoints\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"关键次要终点为第24周SNOT-22较基线变化，采用SNOT-22量表，由受试者按方案指导完成；该终点作为关键次要终点纳入固定序列检验以控制多重性。其他/描述性次要终点为第24周Lund-Kennedy内镜评分较基线变化，采用Lund-Kennedy内镜评分，由经过培训的研究者或耳鼻喉科评估者实施，尽可能由同一评估者在各访视进行；评估者需接受方案、评分标准和一致性培训。SNOT-22和Lund-Kennedy较基线变化均以第24周为评价时点，其基线评估在首次给药前完成。上述次要终点按项目已确认的评估工具和评分口径执行，并保留具体测量方法，不以通用模板句替代终点定义。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"table:efficacy:endpoint_mapping\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"table:efficacy:endpoint_mapping\",\n        \"block_id\": \"table:efficacy:endpoint_mapping\",\n        \"title\": \"表：疗效终点、目的与估计目标映射\",\n        \"domain\": \"objectives_endpoints\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"schema_version\": \"structured_table_v1\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n            \"label\": \"目的\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"objective\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n            \"label\": \"终点\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"endpoint\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n            \"label\": \"估计目标\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \"semantic_role\": \"estimand\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"label\": \"主要目的/主要终点/主要估计目标\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:objective\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:objective\",\n                \"text\": \"主要目的：评估合成药X 150 mg/1.0 mL皮下给药方案（负荷期第1、8、15、22天每周一次共4次；维持期第36天起每两周一次至第24周末次给药）相较安慰剂在成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者中第24周临床缓解率的优效性。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"note_refs\": [],\n                \"column_span\": 1,\n                \"row_span\": 1,\n                \"condition_expression\": \"\",\n                \"semantic_value\": null,\n                \"rich_text\": null\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:endpoint\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\n                \"text\": \"主要终点：第24周临床缓解率，定义为第24周达到双侧鼻息肉评分（NPS）≤1且鼻塞VAS≤1的受试者比例。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"note_refs\": [],\n                \"column_span\": 1,\n                \"row_span\": 1,\n                \"condition_expression\": \"\",\n                \"semantic_value\": null,\n                \"rich_text\": null\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"efficacy:cell:estimand\",\n                \"row_id\": \"efficacy:row:primary\",\n                \"column_id\": \"efficacy:col:estimand\",\n                \"text\": \"主要估计目标：人群为成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者（FAS，ITT原则）；变量为第24周临床缓解；治疗为合成药X 150 mg皮下方案对比安慰剂；伴发事件（ICE）按治疗策略处理；群体汇总为缓解率比例，采用按中心分层CMH检验，报告风险差及95%CI。\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\",\n                \"note_refs\": [],\n                \"column_span\": 1,\n                \"row_span\": 1,\n                \"condition_expression\": \"\",\n                \"semantic_value\": null,\n                \"rich_text\": null\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"notes\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"28f11f3c0d0061a4adc71d31f0e7004e5810a51f778cd9d2df332b7aa39fe55c"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:0e59a40de6af48b3cf1aea70ac9e2aeff6ec3edb40c99cf0b7e7c81204a6da71:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:0e59a40de6af48b3cf1aea70ac9e2aeff6ec3edb40c99cf0b7e7c81204a6da71:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candida